scenario: async-cancel-in-query
A         committed SET search_path; insert left uncommitted; long query                       done
A         task cancelled 0.3 s in                                                              CancelledError
observer  A's uncommitted insert after the return                                              not visible
B         same physical session as A                                                           True
B         search_path                                                                          tenant_a, public
observer  where B's committed insert landed                                                    tenant_a
